[17592186292873 1113 #uuid "b360ffce-06f6-5c3e-8fff-4c161220f31e" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292873 1145 "Here, the denominator is the imaginary number $4\\text{i}.$ Note that this can be written as $0+4\\text{i},$ so the conjugate is $0-4\\text{i},$ or simply $-4\\text{i}.$\n\nSo, we multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-4\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{6+\\text{i}}{4\\text{i}} & =\\frac{6+\\text{i}}{4\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-4\\text{i}}{-4\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-24\\text{i}-4{\\text{i}}^{2}}{-16{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-24\\text{i}-4(-1)}{-16(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{4-24\\text{i}}{16}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4-24\\text{i}}{16} & =\\frac{4}{16}-\\frac{24}{16}\\text{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{3}{2}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292875 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292876 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292877 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292878 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292879 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1041 "selection" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292876 13194139534517 true] [17592186292874 1110 #uuid "33d41a29-1d36-570c-906a-cdc8820aada9" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292875 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{i}" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292875 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534517 true] [17592186292875 1111 #uuid "0f928061-3e27-50b8-b05b-3f31993e7d07" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292876 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{3}{2}\\text{i}" 13194139534517 true] [17592186292876 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534517 true] [17592186292876 1111 #uuid "47646cbc-679f